# Chaque compte ne voit que ses topics (anonyme interdit dans mosquitto.conf)
user chirpstack
topic readwrite eu868/gateway/#
topic readwrite application/#

user homeassistant
# readwrite : downlinks (command/down) + simulateur de démo
topic readwrite application/#
topic readwrite homeassistant/#
topic read frigate/#
# ESP32 (ESPHome, topic_prefix esphome/<nom>) : états + commandes
topic readwrite esphome/#

user frigate
topic readwrite frigate/#

# Tous les ESP32 (ESPHome) : un compte partagé, discovery HA + topics sous esphome/<nom>
user esphome
topic readwrite esphome/#
topic readwrite homeassistant/#
